    "body": "Regarding the in-line commit, I expected the performance increase to be far more significant than the measurements I got because this change should be going from an O(n) operation to an O(1) operation.\r\n\r\nI suspect the biggest cause is just the lack of a proper test setup, and just running the benchmark on my laptop to the highest reasonable limit I could run it with (~200k records).\r\n\r\nAre there tools available to very easily set up a test application for the purposes of benchmarking? That would be extremely handy as I do not have an environment available for experimenting. ",
